<h3 id=3D"dynamic-sliding-window">Dynamic Sliding Window</h3>
<p>Unlike fixed sliding windows, dynamic windows can expand or shrink in le=
ngth as they traverse a data structure.</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
;"><img alt=3D"Image represents a sequence of three diagrams illustrating a=
